ANNEX.text:
${P} RESEARCH REPORT #${ctx.seed * ctx.hours % 666}
AUTHOR: ${c.lead}

It doesn't use the doors.

It doesn't need the doors.

Why did we build doors?

INTERNAL SMTP SERVER REPORT: UNSENT MAIL

FROM: ${c.lost}
TO: ${c.lead}

You keep saying "containment" like the word still means something here. I measured my office again last night. It has been growing by four centimeters a week.

I have stopped reporting it because you have stopped reading these!

${P} OBSERVATION REPORT NO. ${100 + (ctx.seed % 800)}

AUTHOR: ${c.lead}

The architectural shifts are directly proportional to the observer's heart rate.

The walls might look like they are moving, but they aren't. The space *between( them is... breathing.

${c.lost} disagrees. They have been in the halls ${hrs} hours and I no longer consider their ${c.lost}'s disagreements to be anything but manic delusion, now. They are truly lost.

